151
00:08:06,110 --> 00:08:07,370
You know, I broke a glass.

152
00:08:07,900 --> 00:08:15,000
But as far as cars are concerned, you say, you know, a car breaks down or I want to avoid breakdowns.

153
00:08:15,220 --> 00:08:19,100
